# What the sdist carries.
#
# **The test suite is shipped, so it has to be shippable.** The published 1.20.4 sdist held
# `test/test_*.py` and nothing else from that directory: no `_fixtures.py`, so four modules failed at
# import, and no `PERSONA.md` or `tools/pixelart.py`, so five more tests errored on a missing file.
# Measured by unpacking the published sdist and running its suite on Linux: 391 tests, 7 errors.
#
# `tools/` is included because a test imports one of them, and because these scripts are how the numbers
# in the documents were measured -- shipping the claim without the instrument is the shape this project
# keeps correcting.
include LICENSE
include README.md
include PERSONA.md
recursive-include test *.py
recursive-include tools *.py
